<title>MEXICO: Mexico bolsa capitalisation up 15.4 pct on Dec 13.</title>
<headline>Mexico bolsa capitalisation up 15.4 pct on Dec 13.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican Stock Exchange President Manuel Robleda said on Wednesday that market capitalisation as of December 13 was 806 billion pesos, up 15.4 percent compared with the end of 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;The market capitalisation value as of last Friday was 806 billion pesos, up 15.4 percent from December 31, 1995,&quot; Robleda told reporters.</p>
